WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:08.056
For an active-high NOR latch: S=1 sets Q, R=1 resets Q, and S=R=0 holds the stored bit.

00:00:08.056 --> 00:00:09.478
S=R=1 is forbidden.

00:00:09.478 --> 00:00:12.795
A clocked version additionally gates these inputs.

00:00:13.795 --> 00:00:21.851
